==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Stategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

